Package: linux-defender-privileged-helper
Version: VERSION
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: ARCHITECTURE
Depends: pkexec | policykit-1
Replaces: linux-defender (<= VERSION)
Maintainer: Linux Defender contributors <noreply@github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/Linux-Defender/Linux-Defender
Description: Root-owned native pkexec helper and polkit policy for Linux Defender
 Root-owned Rust helper (/usr/bin/clamui-apply-preferences) and the matching
 polkit policy that let Linux Defender apply authorized host ClamAV configuration via
 pkexec.
 .
 This package coexists with linux-defender and owns only the privileged helper and
 policy. linux-defender depends on this exact version.
 .
 Replaces lets dpkg transfer ownership of the helper and policy from an older
 linux-defender package of at most the same version without forcing an uninstall.
